--- Origin of Real Domains ---
Earlier samples with real domains (timesofindia.indiatimes.com, www.thehindu.com) came from live RSS feeds fetched during ingestion adapter runs and stored into weather_platform_audit.public.evidence_items.
The 10,000 example.com rows were generated as synthetic test fixtures (is_test_fixture = true) for benchmark / evidence linking load testing.

